{'symbol': 'BAC', 'date': '2021-11-16 15:00:00', 'title': 'MIAMI SMALL BUSINESS BOOT CAMP WINNERS TO BE SHOWCASED AT UPCOMING HOLIDAY VILLAGE', 'text': 'MIAMI, NOV. 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BANK OF AMERICA, IN PARTNERSHIP WITH STARTUP FIU, AN ENTREPRENEURSHIP AND INNOVATION OF FLORIDA INTERNATIONAL UNIVERSITY, AND THE UNDERLINE, ANNOUNCED TODAY THE 10 WINNERS OF THE INAUGURAL MIAMI SMALL BUSINESS BOOTCAMP DURING A CEREMONY AT THE ADRIENNE ARSHT CENTER FOR THE PERFORMING ARTS OF MIAMI-DADE COUNTY. THE WINNERS, RANGING FROM A MOM-AND-DAUGHTER DUO SPECIALIZING IN ARGENTINIAN TREATS TO THE CREATOR OF A TANDEM BIKE FOR RIDERS WITH SPECIAL NEEDS, EACH RECEIVED AN INVITATION TO SHOWCASE THEIR PRODUCTS AND SERVICES AT THE SMALL BUSINESS HOLIDAY VILLAGE AT THE UNDERLINE FOR TWO CONSECUTIVE WEEKENDS, DECEMBER 10-12 AND DECEMBER 17-19.'}